    "sustainability": {
      "type": "scrolling-columns",
      "blocks": {
        "way_1": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/01_d7e613c5-4fa5-445d-8329-647448dc754a.jpg",
            "text": "<p>We examine the supply chain and identify the pain points throughout the process. Then, transfer the knowledge to our community of like-minded innovators.</p>"
          }
        },
        "way_2": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/02_87372e36-5dec-422d-aa4f-060bb1b50202.jpg",
            "text": "<p>Likewise, we dare to challenge the norm of mass production and forge new ideas in the retail sphere. Currently, we are co-developing with the award-winning architecture firm Snøhetta, a reusable portable display system for offline activations with the hope of reducing retail waste.</p>"
          }
        },
        "way_3": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/03_f6e7991a-e3c4-415c-94d7-491cffb0aac5.jpg",
            "text": "<p>Several of our partnering designers are proud members of the Responsible Jewelry Council. The world's leading standard and authority in the global watch and jewelry industry. Others are B-Corp certified, a stamp of approval on their sustainable practices across the board.</p>"
          }
        },
        "way_4": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/05_1.jpg",
            "text": "<p>Light sensors are placed in frequented locations in our office to save energy and reduce light waste.</p>"
          }
        },
        "column_EmJqd6": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/unav-6_jpg_e4e4de52-fc07-4b64-a9af-20764a10de4b.webp",
            "text": "<p>Most jewels are individually made to reduce waste. Meaning, every item is a consciously produced, well crafted, treasured creation.</p>"
          }
        },
        "column_Hq7WMX": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/david-hofmann-GFt6VfdVdbk-unsplash_jpg_1b1bdf26-4460-4c49-af46-eeaaa7745fa7.webp",
            "text": "<p>Most of our partners use recycled metals sourced and recovered predominantly from discarded electronic devices that are then transformed into modern heirlooms.</p>"
          }
        },
        "column_TYEyGV": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screenshot_2023-08-28_at_14_47_51_png_607049b1-01d5-4ed2-9cde-b514933087fb.webp",
            "text": "<p>We repurpose selected furniture to prolong its life, ensuring that we are consciously using items and promoting sustainable actions in our day to day.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
